      "content": "i don't know. it just feels like an exhausting way to live. if everything is just temporary and ends in nothing, then the \"intensity\" you're talking about is just more noise before the silence. wouldn't it be more logical to just stop the noise early? if the outcome is certain, why drag out the process of suffering through it?",
